# Copy to app/.env and fill in to enable the model-backed coach.
# Without it, the app uses its built-in rules and works fully offline.
#
# The key is read by the coach server only. It is never bundled into anything
# the browser downloads, which is the whole reason that server exists.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# The coach model. Opus gives the best feedback and is the default. A take
# review is one short call, but if cost matters, claude-sonnet-5-5 and
# claude-haiku-5-5 work with the same prompt.
# BASSROOM_COACH_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5

# Where practice telemetry is written. One JSONL file per day.
# BASSROOM_DATA_DIR=../data

# BASSROOM_COACH_PORT=8787
